Description: Lenovo Yoga Book hardware integration validator
 Audits the YB1-X91L kernel, SOF audio, Halo input, Wacom pen, sensors,
 modem, GNSS, cameras, battery and desktop integration. It provides a CLI and
 GTK4/libadwaita UI backed by the same structured reports, with state-safe
 privileged tests and separate physical acceptance.
